Mayday is a demonstration. It is not a certified medical device, it is not a
substitute for emergency medical services, and its simulated dispatcher is not
connected to any real emergency line. The first-aid protocols it coaches are
transcribed from published guidelines (AHA, Stop the Bleed, Red Cross), cited in
each machine file under src/protocol/machines. Anyone redistributing or modifying
this software should read Sections 7 and 8 of the LICENSE.

